u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets\"\u003eto\u003c\/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"heets Kenya\"\u003ebuy heets\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754156599,"sku":"5","price":8500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-2.4-plus-group-with-4-new-heets-WHITE.jpg?v=1743120604"},{"product_id":"smok-solus-g-box-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Solus G-BOX Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eSMOK SOLUS G-BOX Kit features a 700mAh internal battery with max 20W output, compatible with a Solus refillable 0.9ohm pod cartridge that accommodates 2.5ml of vape juice. The 5-20W output range and the airflow draw-activity mode are suitable for the vaper who loves MTL or RDL vaping mode. The PCTG material ensures lightweight while making G-BOX more robust and durable. The pod designed with a magnet design for easy replacement helps to lock and can securely without loosening, making the coil heat quickly. It is equipped with a Type-C charging port that you can enjoy a nice flavor after only 15 minutes of charging.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Solus g-box infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0615\/0343\/8900\/files\/smok-solus-g-box__2.jpg?v=1700522155\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSolus G-Box Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e700mAh Internal Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Range Of 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable 2.5ml Vape Juice Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and Easy-to-use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAir Draw-activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL and RDL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExtensive Security Protection Functions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 71.9* 53* 19mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 700mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: SOLUS 0.9ohm Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower Range: Max 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2.5ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-c Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK Solus G-BOX Kit Package List:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SMOK SOLUS G-BOX Device(700mAh)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x SOLUS Meshed 0.9ohm Pod(2.5ml)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41574754385975,"sku":"20","price":3750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok-solus-g-box-kit.jpg?v=1743120626"},{"product_id":"nasty-bad-blood-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Bad Blood Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eBad Blood Salt \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Liquid nicotine salt\"\u003eLiquid Nicotine Salt\u003c\/a\u003e: One inhale of this wonderfully unique juice and you’ll be head over heels in love! Bad Blood by Nasty Juice is an innovative blend of fresh, natural tasting, ripe blackberry with just the right balance of tart and sweet flavor and a splash of cooling mint that only adds to the authenticity of this shockingly realistic juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754484279,"sku":"Nasty Bad Blood - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754517047,"sku":"Nasty Bad Blood - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-bad-blood-nic-salt-juice-kenya.png?v=1743120648"},{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-lemon-mint","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Lemon Mint","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nics-salts-juices\" title=\"Nasty Juice\"\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/a\u003e Lemon Mint from the shisha series is a bright, sourish and minty combination of clean tasting lemons and peppermint. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend this to those that like the raspberries that want to try a new shisha twist with the addition of sweet green grapes. The raspberries provide an excellent gummy pop to the texture of the clouds when inhaling. It's a fruity sensation like no other. Highly recommended.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754549815,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754582583,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-shisha-salt-lemon-mint.png?v=1743120651"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-strawberry-kiwi-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDelight in the perfect pairing of juicy strawberries and tangy kiwi, creating a harmonious blend of sweet and tart flavors that dance on the palate with each and every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41574754615351,"sku":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41574754648119,"sku":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Strawberry-Kiwi-min.jpg?v=1743120653"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/all.oembed?page=23","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}





